ained Melody\\\" by Les Baxter and his orchestra).\\n\\nMost of us love ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.goldminemag.com/music-history/top-instrumental-songs-from-1950s-and-1960s\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d59\"},\"ref\":\"d59\",\"snippet\":\" ... He has collaborated with the American Composers Orchestra, . . . Imani Winds, . . . and the NDR Big Band . . . [His] concert music has received . . . an ASCAP Morton Gould Award and the International Society of Bassists Composition Contest Grand Prize. He is Assistant Professor of Composition at Stephen F. Austin State University in ... \",\"title\":\"https://artsfuse.org/308089/concert-review-boston-symphony-orchestras-coltrane-legacy-for-orchestra-an-evening-of-worthwhile-rethinkings/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d60\"},\"ref\":\"d60\",\"snippet\":\" ... Opera Houses of Dubai and Tokyo, Midwest Band and Orchestra Clinic, International Women's Brass Conference, International Trumpet Guild Conference, Co-Principal Trumpet (Verbier Festival Chamber Orchestra in Switzerland since 2008); Boston Symphony Orchestra, Milwaukee Symphony. BROADWAY: The Phantom of the Opera, West Side Story, An American in ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.chicagoshakes.com/productions/illinoise/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d61\"},\"ref\":\"d61\",\"snippet\":\" ... His longer works include the Septology trilogy, the third volume of which was shortlisted for the international Booker prize in 2022.\\n\\nSeptology, which Fosse started during a pause from playwriting and after converting to Catholicism in 2013, is about an ageing painter, Asle, living alone on the south ... \",\"title\":\"htt